### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "week7test2@example.com",
  "password": "Week7Test123",
  "name": "Week Seven Test"
}


### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "week7test@example.com",
  "password": "Week7Test123"
}

### Login second user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "week7test2@example.com",
  "password": "Week7Test123"
}

### Create account for second user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Second User Account",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "startAmount": 500.00
}

### Login demo user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@fintracker.local",
  "password": "Demo12345"
